# held/props/bowl: a wooden begging bowl for the Beg posture (PROPS, P2b), in the right hand: in the lap (hold) and held out
# (reach). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Around the pose arms' grips, anchored on the right shoulder; the fist under it.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held bowl
anchor shoulderR
keys held
z 40

view D key hold origin -1 -4 layer armNear
